join Petrus (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Petrus (Warm)
Petrus: How many head has your father got?
Petrus: Mm. Had eleven, when I was your age. Four by the time I was sixty.
Petrus: I said no to the rollers. Said no to the mill. Said no to the pathway and the tank and every other thing anybody's brought into this village in four years.
Petrus: Every single one of them I was wrong about.
Petrus: You can be careful. Careful's worth something. But don't be me — I was careful for eleven years and it cost me seven cattle.
- That was a lot of words for you
	Hope: That was a lot of words for you.
	Petrus: Mm.
	Petrus: Somebody said much the same to me once. About forty years ago.
- Did you listen?
	Hope: Did you listen?
	Petrus: No.
	Petrus: Took me until now. Boy might manage it quicker.
[signal arg="hearts:petrus:2"]
set {GameState.petrus_arc_complete} = true
